Error [E0209]: implicit clone of `msg`
  --> tests/ui/implicit_clone_move.jet:7:13
    |
  7 |     consume(msg)
    |             ^^^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: write the move-capability marker `^` (`^msg`) to move it — this is `msg`'s last use — or the copy marker `~` (`~msg`) to keep a copy
